  "description": "Hugo-Primer’s GitHub-style navigation, raised article cards, Markdown reading styles and sticky taxonomy/heading sidebar.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Qiushi Pan; Firekylin contributors",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/qqhann/hugo-primer",
  "repository": {
